{"seq":1,"slug":"anomaly-diagnosis","title":"流量/转化异常自动诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-business-analytics/diagnosis-advice/anomaly-diagnosis","wordCount":2516,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"流量-转化异常自动诊断\">流量/转化异常自动诊断</h1><p>一个卖家早上打开后台，看到昨天的访客数比前七天均值低了 23%。这条信息本身没有价值——他需要知道的是这 23% 是「真的坏了」还是「周三本来就这样」，如果是真的，坏在哪一层：是进店的人少了，还是进来的人不买了。异常诊断系统要做的就是把这个判断自动化，并且做到一个新开店三个月的卖家也能用，因为这类卖家的历史数据根本不足以做时间序列建模。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>异常诊断与异常检测是两件事。检测回答「这个数是不是偏离了预期」，诊断回答「偏离发生在哪一层、由哪个可控因素导致」。前者是一个统计问题，后者是一个分解问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[观测到指标偏离] --&gt; B{是否显著}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[正常波动, 不打扰卖家]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D[沿漏斗分解]&#10;    D --&gt; E[流量层: 会话数下降]&#10;    D --&gt; F[转化层: 转化率下降]&#10;    E --&gt; G[按渠道拆: 自然/广告/站外]&#10;    F --&gt; H[按商品拆: 哪些SKU掉了]&#10;    G --&gt; I[按市场拆]&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J{可控归因}&#10;    J --&gt; K[断货/超时]&#10;    J --&gt; L[价格变动]&#10;    J --&gt; M[评分/差评]&#10;    J --&gt; N[广告预算/竞价]&#10;    J --&gt; O[外部: 竞品/季节/平台政策]&#10;    K --&gt; P[输出建议]&#10;    L --&gt; P&#10;    M --&gt; P&#10;    N --&gt; P\">graph TD\n    A[观测到指标偏离] --&gt; B{是否显著}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[正常波动, 不打扰卖家]\n    B --&gt;|是| D[沿漏斗分解]\n    D --&gt; E[流量层: 会话数下降]\n    D --&gt; F[转化层: 转化率下降]\n    E --&gt; G[按渠道拆: 自然/广告/站外]\n    F --&gt; H[按商品拆: 哪些SKU掉了]\n    G --&gt; I[按市场拆]\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J{可控归因}\n    J --&gt; K[断货/超时]\n    J --&gt; L[价格变动]\n    J --&gt; M[评分/差评]\n    J --&gt; N[广告预算/竞价]\n    J --&gt; O[外部: 竞品/季节/平台政策]\n    K --&gt; P[输出建议]\n    L --&gt; P\n    M --&gt; P\n    N --&gt; P</pre><p>漏斗分解用乘法的可加性把总变化拆开。成交额等于三个量的乘积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>GMV</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Sessions</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>CVR</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>AOV</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{GMV} = \\text{Sessions} \\times \\text{CVR} \\times \\text{AOV}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Sessions</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CVR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AOV</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>取对数后是加法，于是总变化的对数可以被精确分解为三项贡献：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext>GMV</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext>Sessions</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext>CVR</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext>AOV</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta \\ln \\text{GMV} = \\Delta \\ln \\text{Sessions} + \\Delta \\ln \\text{CVR} + \\Delta \\ln \\text{AOV}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Sessions</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CVR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AOV</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一步是整个诊断系统的骨架：它把「成交额掉了 20%」这个模糊陈述变成三个可独立检验的数。如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext>Sessions</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.19</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta \\ln \\text{Sessions} = -0.19</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Sessions</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.19</span></span></span></span></span> 而另外两项接近零，问题在流量；如果流量持平而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext>CVR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta \\ln \\text{CVR} = -0.18</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CVR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.18</span></span></span></span></span>，问题在转化。这个分解是精确的（不是近似），所以三项贡献之和必然等于总变化，不会出现「每项都只掉了一点但总掉了很多」这种无法归因的情形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"没有历史数据时怎么建基线\">没有历史数据时怎么建基线</h2><p>时间序列异常检测的教科书做法是拿过去 N 天的同环比做基线，但这在新店或者刚换季的店铺上失效。工程上有三档由弱到强的基线，后台应该按数据可用性自动升级。</p>\n<p><strong>第一档：同类店铺横截面基线。</strong> 新店没有自己的历史，但有同品类同价位其他店铺的历史（匿名聚合）。用别人的历史波动区间作为自己的预期范围，代价是无法反映店铺自身的特性——一个长期稳定的店铺会被判定为「过于平稳」而失去敏感性。这一档的实现依赖 <a href=\"benchmark-comparison\">同行/类目对标</a> 中的匿名分位数据，两者共用同一套小样本保护机制。</p>\n<p><strong>第二档：自身历史的稳健统计。</strong> 有 4 到 8 周数据后可以建自己的基线。关键是<strong>不要用均值加减标准差</strong>——电商指标的分布严重右偏（大促日、爆单日会把标准差撑大），用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>σ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\mu - 2\\sigma, \\mu + 2\\sigma]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 会让检测阈值宽到失去作用。正确的是用中位数与 MAD（中位数绝对偏差）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MAD</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>median</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mtext>median</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MAD} = \\text{median}\\left(|x_i - \\text{median}(x)|\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">median</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">median</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>稳健 z 值</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.6745</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mtext>median</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mtext>MAD</mtext></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mtext>median</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1.4826</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>MAD</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{稳健 z 值} = \\frac{0.6745 \\cdot (x - \\text{median}(x))}{\\text{MAD}} \\approx \\frac{x - \\text{median}(x)}{1.4826 \\cdot \\text{MAD}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">稳健</span><span class=\"mord\"> z </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAD</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.6745</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">median</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1.4826</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAD</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">median</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 1.4826 是让 MAD 在正态分布下与标准差可比的换算常数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>0.67449</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.4826</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\Phi^{-1}(3/4) \\approx 1/0.67449 \\approx 1.4826</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3/4</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/0.67449</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.4826</span></span></span></span></span>，来源：Median absolute deviation 词条，<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Median_absolute_deviation）。稳健\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Median_absolute_deviation）。稳健</a> z 值的可用阈值通常在 3 到 3.5 之间（Iglewicz 与 Hoaglin 推荐把修正 z 值绝对值超过 3.5 的观测标为可疑离群点，来源：NIST/SEMATECH e-Handbook of Statistical Methods §1.3.5.3，<a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda35h.htm），但电商数据不是正态的，所以阈值还要结合下面两条一起用。\">https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda35h.htm），但电商数据不是正态的，所以阈值还要结合下面两条一起用。</a></p>\n<p><strong>第三档：季节性分解。</strong> 有 3 个月以上数据后引入星期效应与节假日效应。电商的星期效应非常强（周末与工作日的流量结构、转化率都不同），不做星期对齐的异常检测会在每周固定时间误报。做法是把每天的观测值除以「同星期几的历史中位数」得到去星期后的残差，再对残差做稳健 z 检验。节假日与平台大促（Prime Day、双十一、黑五）必须作为显式的日历事件剔除或单独建模，否则大促后一周的「正常」会被大促期间的峰值污染。</p>\n<p>三档之外还有一条工程纪律：<strong>基线必须滚动且可以被打断</strong>。当店铺发生了结构性变化（新增市场、换了主营类目、改了发货时效），旧基线的参考价值下降，系统应该检测到这种断裂并重置基线窗口，而不是继续用陈旧基线产生误报。这属于 <a href=\"../analytics-serving/report-export\">经营报表定时导出</a> 中报表口径需要断点标注的同一个问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从多个异常信号到一个根因\">从多个异常信号到一个根因</h2><p>后台的每个指标都会单独报警的话，卖家会收到几十条通知然后全部忽略。根因收敛的目标是<strong>把 N 个相关异常压成一条可解释的结论</strong>。</p>\n<p>收敛的第一条规则是<strong>优先级短路</strong>。某些异常一旦发生，其它异常都是它的结果：库存为零、店铺被暂停、支付方式失效、物流模板过期。这些叫硬故障，检测到后直接输出结论并抑制所有下游告警。这与 <a href=\"product-performance-seller\">商品/链接表现与诊断</a> 中「商品健康分不能用六维加权平均」是同一个设计的另一面。</p>\n<p>第二条规则是<strong>共同的维度归因</strong>。如果十个 SKU 的转化率同时下滑，先检查它们的共同属性：是否都属于同一个变体父体（改价了）、是否都在同一个市场（该市场大促结束）、是否都用了同一个物流模板（承运商问题）、是否共享同一个关键词（排名掉了）。共同属性的检测是一个集合求交问题：把异常 SKU 集合与每个维度的成员集合求交，交集占比显著高于基准的维度就是候选根因。这个操作在 SQL 里是多次 <code>GROUP BY</code> 加交集，工程上成本可控。</p>\n<p>第三条规则是<strong>时间上的相关性</strong>。如果流量下降开始于某个整点、或者精确地在某次配置变更之后，那么这个时点本身就是证据。系统应该维护一个「变更事件流」——卖家改了价格、改了库存、改了广告预算、平台发布了政策变更、系统做了版本升级——并把异常的发生时点与变更事件做时间对齐。这一步的价值极高：<strong>大部分「异常」其实是卖家自己或平台自己造成的，能被解释的异常不需要被修复</strong>。一个能回答「你的转化率下降始于你昨天下午 3 点把价格从 19.9 改成 24.9」的系统，比一个只会报警的系统有用一个数量级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抑制误报的四个工程手段\">抑制误报的四个工程手段</h2><p>误报是这类系统最大的失败模式——不是技术失败，是信任失败。卖家在第十次收到无意义的告警之后就不再看了。四个手段值得写进设计。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最小量级门槛</td>\n<td>变化幅度低于 X% 或绝对量低于 Y 不报</td>\n<td>会漏掉小店铺的真实小变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续性要求</td>\n<td>需要连续 K 个时间桶都偏离才告警</td>\n<td>检测延迟增加 K 个桶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多重比较校正</td>\n<td>同时检验 M 个指标时提高单指标阈值</td>\n<td>灵敏度下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分组冷却</td>\n<td>同一根因组内告警合并，冷却期内不重复</td>\n<td>可能压掉后续的真实新异常</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>多重比较校正这一条最容易被忽略。如果一个店铺有 50 个 SKU 和 6 个指标，一天内就是对 300 个时间序列做检验；在 99.7% 的单次置信水平下，平均每天仍有约 0.9 个纯噪声会越过阈值。Bonferroni 校正（把阈值对应的 p 值除以检验次数，即在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha/m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 的显著性水平上检验每个假设）是最保守的做法（来源：Bonferroni correction 词条，<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bonferroni_correction），实际系统里更常用的是分层检验：先在店铺层检验总指标，只有总指标异常时才下钻到\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bonferroni_correction），实际系统里更常用的是分层检验：先在店铺层检验总指标，只有总指标异常时才下钻到</a> SKU 层，下钻时再放宽单 SKU 的阈值。这样既控制了上层误报率，又保住了下钻时的灵敏度。</p>\n<p>最小量级门槛必须<strong>与店铺规模自适应</strong>。对一个日成交 50 单的店铺，「下降 10%」意味着 5 单，纯随机波动就能产生；对一个日成交 5000 单的店铺，下降 10% 已经是 500 单，几乎不可能是噪声。所以门槛应该是「统计显著且业务显著」的交集：统计上过稳健 z 检验，业务上变化量超过该店铺规模下的最小可觉差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>检测与诊断分离：检测判断偏离是否显著，诊断用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>GMV</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Sessions</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>CVR</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>AOV</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{GMV} = \\text{Sessions} \\times \\text{CVR} \\times \\text{AOV}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Sessions</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CVR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AOV</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的对数分解把偏离落到具体层。</li>\n<li>基线分三档升级：横截面同类基线（新店）→ 自身稳健统计（4-8 周）→ 季节性分解（3 个月以上，需处理星期效应与节假日）。</li>\n<li>稳健统计用中位数与 MAD 而非均值标准差，因为电商指标分布右偏；大促与节假日必须显式建模。</li>\n<li>根因收敛三条规则：硬故障短路、异常集合的共同维度求交、异常时点与变更事件流对齐。</li>\n<li>误报抑制四手段：最小量级门槛、连续性要求、多重比较校正（分层检验优于 Bonferroni）、分组冷却；门槛需与店铺规模自适应。</li>\n<li>检测到异常之后要变成动作，见 <a href=\"action-suggestion\">可执行优化建议</a>；没有自身历史时依赖品类基线，见 <a href=\"benchmark-comparison\">同行/类目对标</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"流量/转化异常自动诊断","id":"流量-转化异常自动诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"没有历史数据时怎么建基线","id":"没有历史数据时怎么建基线"},{"level":2,"text":"从多个异常信号到一个根因","id":"从多个异常信号到一个根因"},{"level":2,"text":"抑制误报的四个工程手段","id":"抑制误报的四个工程手段"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"广告花费与 ROAS 归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-business-analytics/seller-metrics/ad-roas-attribution"},"next":{"title":"可执行优化建议（改价/补货/广告）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-business-analytics/diagnosis-advice/action-suggestion"}}